# Copy this file to sensitive-terms.local.txt (gitignored, never committed)
# and add terms too sensitive to list in the public sensitive-terms.txt —
# e.g. internal codenames, other people's real names, internal hostnames.
#
# Same format as sensitive-terms.txt: one term per line, case-insensitive,
# whole-word match. Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Reminder: this file is only checked locally, NOT in CI (CI checks out a
# clean tree and never sees gitignored files). Anything that must be
# enforced for every contributor and every push belongs in the committed
# sensitive-terms.txt instead.
